        <p style="margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <em style="color: var(--text-muted); display: block; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-logo);">
                "Structure comes before representation and manifestation. First speak the data."
            </em>
        </p>

        <!-- FORMULA DELLA MATRICE UNIVERSALE DI FAURE INTEGRATA IN MONOSPACE -->
        <div style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px;">
            <span><strong>ORCID:</strong> 0009-0009-5333-1181</span>
            <span><strong>Matrix:</strong> U_F = (M, G, A, Ψ, Λ, Π)</span>
